				'''
			LeafWings:
				'''
				+5 defence, 5% increased damage reduction,
				and permanent Dryad's Blessing while wearing the Tiki Armor
				'''
			BatWings:
				'''
				At night or during an eclipse, you will gain the following boosts:
				7% increased damage and 3% increased critical strike chance
				'''
			TatteredFairyWings: 5% increased damage and critical strike chance
			SpookyWings: Increased minion knockback and 5% increased minion damage while wearing the Spooky Armor
			Hoverboard:
				'''
				5% increased weapon-type damage while wearing the Shroomite Armor
