ConfigDisabled: {
	needsThorium: Requires Thorium. You don't have Thorium.
	needsCalamity: Requires Calamity which is not installed.
	needsStarlightRiver: Requires Starlight River which is not installed.
	needsColouredDamageTypes: Requires Coloured Damage Types. Without it there are no colours to damage, or types to colour, or anything really.
	needsInfernum: Requires Calamity Mod: Infernum Mode which is not installed.
	onlyWithoutCalamity: These re-add Calamity's good ideas to a game that doesn't have Calamity. You already have Calamity, shoo
	noCalamityOverlap: This feature is also added by Calamity, this is disabled to prevent duplication and clashes.
}

SpawnConditions: {
	Guide: He's there from the start. If he's gone, that's on you.
	Merchant: Any player holding 50 silver.
	Nurse: Over 100 max life, with the Merchant already around.
	Demolitionist: Have an explosive in your inventory.
	DyeTrader: Own a dye or a Strange Plant.
	Angler: Asleep at the ocean. Go wake him up.
	BestiaryGirl: Fill in 10% of the Bestiary.
	Dryad: Defeat a boss. She ain't got very high standards.
	Painter: 8 town NPCs living in the world.
	Golfer: Rescue him in the Underground Desert.
	ArmsDealer: Have bullets or a gun.
	DD2Bartender: Lurches in after you defeat the Eater of Worlds or the Brain of Cthulhu.
	Stylist: Rescue her from a Spider Cave.
	GoblinTinkerer: Rescue him underground after beating a Goblin Army.
	WitchDoctor: Defeat Queen Bee.
	Clothier: Defeat Skeletron.
	Mechanic: Rescue her from the Dungeon.
	PartyGirl: Get 14 town NPCs, she spawns with a 2.5% chance every morning.
	Wizard: Rescue him in the hardmode Caverns.
	TaxCollector: Throw Purification Powder on a Tortured Soul in the Underworld.
	Truffle: Make a surface Glowing Mushroom house, in hardmode.
	Pirate: Beat a Pirate Invasion.
	Steampunker: Defeat any mechanical boss.
	Cyborg: Defeat Plantera.
	SantaClaus: Beat the Frost Legion during Christmas.
	Princess: House every other regular town NPC first.
	TownCat: Buy a Cat License, sold by the Zoologist.
	TownDog: Buy a Dog License, sold by the Zoologist once the Cat License has been bought.
	TownBunny: Buy a  Bunny License, sold by the Zoologist once the Dog License has been bought.
	TownSlimeBlue: Defeat King Slime.
	TownSlimeOld: Free him from the Dungeon with a Golden Key.
	TownSlimeGreen: Slime-related shenanigans, party hard!
	TownSlimePurple: Slime-related shenanigans, be a party popper.
	TownSlimeRainbow: Slime-related shenanigans, gamer girl bathwater into shimmer.
	TownSlimeRed: Slime-related shenanigans, nautical edition.
	TownSlimeYellow: Slime-related shenanigans, purify a Mystic Frog in the Jungle.
	TownSlimeCopper: Slime-related shenanigans, chivalrous edition. (Copper Helmet / Shortsword)
	Unknown: Spawn conditions unknown. A mystery tenant.
}

Census: {
	next: Next in line to arrive.
	ready: Ready to move in, just needs some housing.
	prices: Prices: {0}%
	lovesEveryone: everyone. Yes, even you.
}
